        <p>Véra is a jailbreak released on August 10, 2026 by developers Ava and sparklerfish. It achieves root access on newer Kindle models — including the Kindle Paperwhite 6, Colorsoft, and 2024 Scribe — using only the Kindle's built-in web browser and two specially prepared books. No computer is required.</p>
